  <collaboration id="Id_514d7c62-865c-47c7-87a7-43ef7e4345e1" name="P07. Seleção do Fornecedor">
    <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Processo de sele&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do fornecedor considerando a sinergia entre as atividades diversas dos munic&amp;iacute;pios e da Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133/2021 - Lei de Licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es e Contrados Administrativos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
